"21tyegy2oyd": "From: Seo Gi-bong, Pyongyang-bu → To: Seo Gi-ryong, Seogwang Tailors, Sunamgol, Gyeongseong",
"zyzx69rqpy": "[Translation] What money? Let me know. Bong",
