"11o78hhicpj": "From: Oh Sun-deok → To: the Oh household, [[Gaeseong|k_gaeseong]]-bu",
"19l5idjnhdl": "[Translation] Broadcast cut off midway but I am safe. Do not worry. Sun-deok",
