"esj0jjewuj": "From: a certain broker by the Incheon Rice Exchange → To: Jeong ○○, guest at the [[Songhak Inn|k_songhak]], Sunamgol",
"uwqdpdbjcj": "[Translation] Rice falling. Sell at once.",
"1edyo6facib": "Addressed to a guest at the Songhak Inn. No connection with the case established.",
